# Vercel's own deploy file-listing doesn't always honor nested .gitignore
# entries the way git itself does -- .venv-ml/ alone is 35,000+ files
# (PyTorch/transformers site-packages) and blew past Vercel's 15,000-file
# upload limit. None of this is needed for the deployed app anyway: the
# Python fine-tuning scripts run offline, never at request time.
.venv-ml/
.venv/
data/ml/artifacts/
